{"symbol":"PPA.AT","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:19:22Z","info":{"address1":"10 Akti Miaouli Street","city":"Piraeus","zip":"18538","country":"Greece","phone":"30 210 45 50 000","fax":"30 210 45 50 304","website":"https://www.olp.gr","industry":"Marine Shipping","industryKey":"marine-shipping","industryDisp":"Marine Shipping","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Piraeus Port Authority S.A., together with its subsidiaries, provides port services in Greece. It operates through Container Terminal; Consession Arrangement Pier II &III; Car Terminal; Coasting; Cruise; Ship repairing; and Other segments. The company offers containers, cruise, car, coastal terminal services; and ship repair services. It also operates dry docks; operates real estate properties, such as warehouses, cafes, canteens, as well as outdoor areas for canteens, ticket kiosks, isoboxes and atms, indoor areas/offices/ stores; leases land and buildings; and provision of logistics services. In addition, the company provides anchoring services of vessels; handling cargo; loading and unloading services, as well as goods storage and car transportation; maintenance of port facilities; water, electricity, and telephone connection services; and coastal and cruise ship travel services. Piraeus Port Authority S.A. was founded in 1930 and is based in Piraeus, Greece. Piraeus Port Authority S.A. is a subsidiary of COSCO SHIPPING (Hong Kong) Limited.","fullTimeEmployees":1133,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Chao  Han","title":"Executive Chairman of the Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Su  Xudong","title":"CEO & Executive Director","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Captain Beiyuan  Jin","title":"Deputy Chief Executive Officer","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":43.05,"open":42.05,"dayLow":42.05,"day